abstract: >
  Machine-learning framework for probabilistic prediction of soft proton
  high-flux intervals relevant for SMILE SXI shutter operations using
  Logistic Regression, XGBoost, and ensemble classification models trained
  on Cluster/RAPID and OMNI data.

